.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Introduces to \fBTest\fP Driven Development in general and attempts to provide a CSMP++ specific approach\&. 

UnitTests and \fBTest\fP Driven Development increase confidence in the code you write and drastically reduce debugging needs\&. In an environment like CSMP that is not tested bottom up, a different approach to testing new classes may be chosen\&. Also for classes that act on a \fBcsmp::Model\fP, the user might skip test driven development/unit testing due to the high effort required\&. This document tries to provide an approach to CSMP specific TDD\&.

.PP
